    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on a bullet-dodging, chaos-filled mission deep behind enemy lines in <i>Darkenstein 3-D</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inspired by the brutal rhythm of <i>Return to Castle Wolfenstein</i> and the glory of 90s shooters, this retro FPS blends old-school secrets, explosive physics, and a story driven by desperation \u2014 and a dog.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195910/extras/dff38e45bb267b363b919f2de810d53a.webp?t=1749580956\" /></div>Embody the fury of the Hobo Guy \u2014 a furious American drifter lost in enemy territory, armed with nothing but a shotgun and vengeance. In 1940s Germany, he's outnumbered and outgunned, but he\u2019s not backing down. This isn\u2019t even about justice \u2014 it\u2019s personal. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195910/extras/714cc55e7011fef43f29a6b5c4975a8d.webp?t=1749580956\" /></div>Gunther, your loyal dog, is taken during a Nazi raid. Now he's locked deep inside enemy strongholds, and you'll have to fight your way through bunkers, castles, valleys, and more to get him back. Along the way, you'll uncover fortresses, alien secrets, and strange powers all caught in a crumbling war. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195910/extras/d09df797d6a6d743be36a369b640e3dc.webp?t=1749580956\" /></div><i>Darkenstein 3-D</i> plays fast \u2014 but not brainless. Enemy projectiles can be dodged, and survival means mastering positioning, movement, and aim. Every fight is a deadly dance of strafes, corners, and timing. No cover mechanics, no aim assist \u2014 just raw gunplay. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195910/extras/5bb6d44d8a625b02a33c4b7a5bb12eed.webp?t=1749580956\" /></div>Each of the 13 handcrafted levels ramps up the pressure. You'll explore castles, caves, valleys and desert towns, unlocking doors with hidden keys, discovering secrets, collecting treasure, and maximizing your score. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195910/extras/c3f2d81eb8bf3621e43537bbb4157d8b.webp?t=1749580956\" /></div>You won\u2019t fight alone. Your rat companion joins the bloodbath, lunging at enemies and sowing chaos in tight firefights. Combine him with grenades and mines for maximum carnage \u2014 he\u2019s small, angry, and very hungry. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195910/extras/a0bc6c831690af418fc08ddef3a0b259.webp?t=1749580956\" /></div>We got gibs. We got physics. Enemies go flying, ragdoll over railings, and explode into glorious red mist. Props scatter and shatter during firefights, turning rooms into debris-filled warzones. Every shot <i>feels</i> like it counts \u2014 and every kill <i>looks</i> like it hurts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195910/extras/ae43ac2204788e39e72f634bdf558050.webp?t=1749580956\" /></div>No microtransactions. No battle passes. No currency systems. Just one complete, free retro FPS \u2014 the way it used to be. <br><br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195910/extras/c3bcabf83ed3bfa46b74ebf77a5b9790.webp?t=1749580956\" /></div>Created over four years by a solo developer, <i>Darkenstein 3-D</i> delivers many hours of punchy, replayable carnage. What started as a rough prototype evolved into a full campaign \u2014 hard, funny, handcrafted, and ready for war.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on a bullet-dodging, chaos-filled mission deep behind enemy lines in <i>Darkenstein 3-D</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inspired by the brutal rhythm of <i>Return to Castle Wolfenstein</i> and the glory of 90s shooters, this retro FPS blends old-school secrets, explosive physics, and a story driven by desperation \u2014 and a dog.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195910/extras/dff38e45bb267b363b919f2de810d53a.webp?t=1749580956\" /></div>Embody the fury of the Hobo Guy \u2014 a furious American drifter lost in enemy territory, armed with nothing but a shotgun and vengeance. In 1940s Germany, he's outnumbered and outgunned, but he\u2019s not backing down. This isn\u2019t even about justice \u2014 it\u2019s personal. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195910/extras/714cc55e7011fef43f29a6b5c4975a8d.webp?t=1749580956\" /></div>Gunther, your loyal dog, is taken during a Nazi raid. Now he's locked deep inside enemy strongholds, and you'll have to fight your way through bunkers, castles, valleys, and more to get him back. Along the way, you'll uncover fortresses, alien secrets, and strange powers all caught in a crumbling war. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195910/extras/d09df797d6a6d743be36a369b640e3dc.webp?t=1749580956\" /></div><i>Darkenstein 3-D</i> plays fast \u2014 but not brainless. Enemy projectiles can be dodged, and survival means mastering positioning, movement, and aim. Every fight is a deadly dance of strafes, corners, and timing. No cover mechanics, no aim assist \u2014 just raw gunplay. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195910/extras/5bb6d44d8a625b02a33c4b7a5bb12eed.webp?t=1749580956\" /></div>Each of the 13 handcrafted levels ramps up the pressure. You'll explore castles, caves, valleys and desert towns, unlocking doors with hidden keys, discovering secrets, collecting treasure, and maximizing your score. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195910/extras/c3f2d81eb8bf3621e43537bbb4157d8b.webp?t=1749580956\" /></div>You won\u2019t fight alone. Your rat companion joins the bloodbath, lunging at enemies and sowing chaos in tight firefights. Combine him with grenades and mines for maximum carnage \u2014 he\u2019s small, angry, and very hungry. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195910/extras/a0bc6c831690af418fc08ddef3a0b259.webp?t=1749580956\" /></div>We got gibs. We got physics. Enemies go flying, ragdoll over railings, and explode into glorious red mist. Props scatter and shatter during firefights, turning rooms into debris-filled warzones. Every shot <i>feels</i> like it counts \u2014 and every kill <i>looks</i> like it hurts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195910/extras/ae43ac2204788e39e72f634bdf558050.webp?t=1749580956\" /></div>No microtransactions. No battle passes. No currency systems. Just one complete, free retro FPS \u2014 the way it used to be. <br><br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195910/extras/c3bcabf83ed3bfa46b74ebf77a5b9790.webp?t=1749580956\" /></div>Created over four years by a solo developer, <i>Darkenstein 3-D</i> delivers many hours of punchy, replayable carnage. What started as a rough prototype evolved into a full campaign \u2014 hard, funny, handcrafted, and ready for war.</p>",
